{"id":24,"slug":"24-khi-nao-dung-dl-dt-dd","category":"HTML","subcategory":"Semantic","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Khi nào dùng `<dl>`, `<dt>`, `<dd>`?","question_en":"When should you use `<dl>`, `<dt>`, and `<dd>`?","answer_vi":"`<dl>` là danh sách **cặp khoá – giá trị** hoặc **thuật ngữ – định nghĩa**.\n\n```html\n<dl>\n  <dt>Tác giả</dt>\n  <dd>Nguyễn Đăng Định</dd>\n\n  <dt>Ngày đăng</dt>\n  <dd><time datetime=\"2026-03-15\">15/3/2026</time></dd>\n\n  <dt>Thẻ</dt>            <!-- một dt, nhiều dd -->\n  <dd>React</dd>\n  <dd>Performance</dd>\n</dl>\n```\n\nPhù hợp nhất cho: metadata bài viết, glossary, bảng thông số sản phẩm, FAQ (`<dt>` là câu hỏi, `<dd>` là câu trả lời).\n\nKhi cần một lớp bọc để style, spec chỉ cho phép `<div>` bao cặp `dt`/`dd` bên trong `<dl>`, **không cho phép thẻ khác**.\n\n**Lưu ý:** lỗi hay gặp là dùng `<ul><li>Tác giả: ...</li></ul>` cho danh sách key–value vì tiện. Nó vẫn chạy, nhưng screen reader mất quan hệ khoá–giá trị và mất luôn thông tin \"một khoá có nhiều giá trị\".","answer_en":"`<dl>` is a list of **key–value** or **term–definition** pairs.\n\n```html\n<dl>\n  <dt>Author</dt>\n  <dd>Nguyen Dang Dinh</dd>\n\n  <dt>Published</dt>\n  <dd><time datetime=\"2026-03-15\">March 15, 2026</time></dd>\n\n  <dt>Tags</dt>           <!-- one dt, several dd -->\n  <dd>React</dd>\n  <dd>Performance</dd>\n</dl>\n```\n\nGood fits: article metadata, glossaries, product spec tables, FAQs (`<dt>` the question, `<dd>` the answer).\n\nWhen you need a styling wrapper, use `<div>` — the spec allows `<div>` around a `dt`/`dd` group inside `<dl>`, but **no other element**.\n\n**Note:** a common mistake is falling back to `<ul><li>Author: ...</li></ul>` because it is easier. It renders fine, but screen readers lose the key–value relationship and the \"one key, several values\" grouping.","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>&lt;dl&gt;</code> là danh sách <strong>cặp khoá – giá trị</strong> hoặc <strong>thuật ngữ – định nghĩa</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;dl&gt;\n  &lt;dt&gt;Tác giả&lt;/dt&gt;\n  &lt;dd&gt;Nguyễn Đăng Định&lt;/dd&gt;\n\n  &lt;dt&gt;Ngày đăng&lt;/dt&gt;\n  &lt;dd&gt;&lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-03-15&quot;&gt;15/3/2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/dd&gt;\n\n  &lt;dt&gt;Thẻ&lt;/dt&gt;            &lt;!-- một dt, nhiều dd --&gt;\n  &lt;dd&gt;React&lt;/dd&gt;\n  &lt;dd&gt;Performance&lt;/dd&gt;\n&lt;/dl&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dl</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dt</span>&gt;</span>Tác giả<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dt</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span>Nguyễn Đăng Định<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dt</span>&gt;</span>Ngày đăng<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dt</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">time</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">datetime</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;2026-03-15&quot;</span>&gt;</span>15/3/2026<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">time</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dt</span>&gt;</span>Thẻ<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dt</span>&gt;</span>            <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- một dt, nhiều dd --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span>React<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span>Performance<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dl</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Phù hợp nhất cho: metadata bài viết, glossary, bảng thông số sản phẩm, FAQ (<code>&lt;dt&gt;</code> là câu hỏi, <code>&lt;dd&gt;</code> là câu trả lời).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Khi cần một lớp bọc để style, spec chỉ cho phép <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> bao cặp <code>dt</code>/<code>dd</code> bên trong <code>&lt;dl&gt;</code>, <strong>không cho phép thẻ khác</strong>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> lỗi hay gặp là dùng <code>&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tác giả: ...&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</code> cho danh sách key–value vì tiện. Nó vẫn chạy, nhưng screen reader mất quan hệ khoá–giá trị và mất luôn thông tin \"một khoá có nhiều giá trị\".</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>&lt;dl&gt;</code> is a list of <strong>key–value</strong> or <strong>term–definition</strong> pairs.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;dl&gt;\n  &lt;dt&gt;Author&lt;/dt&gt;\n  &lt;dd&gt;Nguyen Dang Dinh&lt;/dd&gt;\n\n  &lt;dt&gt;Published&lt;/dt&gt;\n  &lt;dd&gt;&lt;time datetime=&quot;2026-03-15&quot;&gt;March 15, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/dd&gt;\n\n  &lt;dt&gt;Tags&lt;/dt&gt;           &lt;!-- one dt, several dd --&gt;\n  &lt;dd&gt;React&lt;/dd&gt;\n  &lt;dd&gt;Performance&lt;/dd&gt;\n&lt;/dl&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dl</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dt</span>&gt;</span>Author<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dt</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span>Nguyen Dang Dinh<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dt</span>&gt;</span>Published<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dt</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">time</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">datetime</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;2026-03-15&quot;</span>&gt;</span>March 15, 2026<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">time</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dt</span>&gt;</span>Tags<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dt</span>&gt;</span>           <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- one dt, several dd --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span>React<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span>Performance<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dd</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">dl</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Good fits: article metadata, glossaries, product spec tables, FAQs (<code>&lt;dt&gt;</code> the question, <code>&lt;dd&gt;</code> the answer).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">When you need a styling wrapper, use <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> — the spec allows <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> around a <code>dt</code>/<code>dd</code> group inside <code>&lt;dl&gt;</code>, but <strong>no other element</strong>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Note:</strong> a common mistake is falling back to <code>&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Author: ...&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</code> because it is easier. It renders fine, but screen readers lose the key–value relationship and the \"one key, several values\" grouping.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — <dl>","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/dl"},{"label":"HTML Standard — the dl element","url":"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/grouping-content.html#the-dl-element"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/16-semantic-html-la-gi-tai-sao-quan-trong","title":"Semantic HTML là gì? Tại sao quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/17-su-khac-biet-giua-div-va-section-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa `<div>` và `<section>` là gì?"},{"url":"/q/18-article-va-section-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"`<article>` và `<section>` khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/19-header-footer-nav-main-aside-dung-khi-nao","title":"`<header>`, `<footer>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<aside>` dùng khi nào?"},{"url":"/q/20-figure-va-figcaption-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"`<figure>` và `<figcaption>` dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/21-mark-strong-em-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"`<mark>`, `<strong>`, `<em>` khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/22-the-time-duoc-su-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"Thẻ `<time>` được sử dụng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/23-semantic-html-anh-huong-seo-nhu-the-nao","title":"Semantic HTML ảnh hưởng SEO như thế nào?"}]}